\uc0\u11835 \
\
Inappropriate AI Tasks\
\
Writing complete paragraphs.\
\
Replacing student thinking.\
\
Generating entire essays.\
\
Automatically rewriting work.\
\
Those features undermine the educational philosophy.\
\
